  "body": "Set in a peaceful cul-de-sac, this well-presented single level family home offers comfortable living, a separate sleepout and plenty of onsite parking, all in a convenient and family-friendly location.\r\n\r\nMain House:\r\n• Three generous bedrooms\r\n•  Spacious living area with high ceilings and large windows\r\n•  Modern kitchen with quality appliances\r\n•  Contemporary family bathroom\r\n•  Easy indoor-outdoor flow\r\n•  Wraparound decking for outdoor entertaining\r\n•  Private, well-fenced outdoor area\r\n\r\nSeparate Sleepout:\r\n• Private and self-contained space\r\n•  Own bathroom\r\n•  Separate entrance\r\n•  Dedicated storage space\r\n•  Ideal for extended family, guests or teenagers\r\n\r\nThe property also offers plenty of onsite parking, providing excellent convenience for families, guests and multiple vehicles.\r\n\r\nLocated within the Macleans Primary and Pakuranga College school zones, The home is conveniently located close to Highland Park Shopping Centre and the new PAK’nSAVE, with everyday amenities and transport links easily accessible.\r\n\r\nA comfortable family home offering privacy, excellent parking, great school zoning and the added benefit of a separate sleepout.\r\n\r\n4A Pauline Place is also available.\r\n\r\nCall us today for more information!",
